# tree
File
  TypeDecl
    LineComment "// Type-position member projection: a type expression Type.member resolves to the"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// member's declared type. The unified member resolution that answers a value's"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// Type.member answers it in type position too — a record field projects to its"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// declared type, an associated constant and an enum member to theirs, a static fn"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// to its function type. The projected type is the one declared, not the structure"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// it aliases, so a schema change to the source type follows wherever it is"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// projected. Projections resolve lazily and may chain; a chain that grounds on a"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// concrete type bottoms out (only a ground-less mutual projection, rejected"
    Newline "\n"
    LineComment "// elsewhere, has no fixed point)."
    Newline "\n"
    Newline "\n"
